{"data":{"ExtRef_Child_hu_note":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"（戊子，七四八）","note_content_jianti_auto":"（戊子，七四八）","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5edc-db0e-11ef-ae56-a0d3651f611f"},"ExtRef_Children_contents":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5edf-db0e-11ef-8b88-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"知內侍省事自此始。唐制：勳階二十九，驃騎大將軍爲之首，從一品。監，古銜翻。驃，匹妙翻。騎，奇寄翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"知内侍省事自此始。唐制：勋阶二十九，骠骑大将军为之首，从一品。监，古衔翻。骠，匹妙翻。骑，奇寄翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5ede-db0e-11ef-9f49-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"將，卽亮翻。相，悉亮翻。貲，卽移翻；不貲，言不可算計也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"将，即亮翻。相，悉亮翻。赀，即移翻；不赀，言不可算计也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5ee1-db0e-11ef-b157-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋璟","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋璟","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5ee3-db0e-11ef-8d2d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"宋璟若在，必不預斯集矣。朝，直遙翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"宋璟若在，必不预斯集矣。朝，直遥翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5ee2-db0e-11ef-b7fb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"左監門大將軍","official_note":"左監門大將軍是唐代禁军将领，负责宫门守卫，此处高力士担任此职，显示其军事权力。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"左監門大將軍","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9f6ba9e1-dd65-4be7-9eb9-69196dbc5a45"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"知內待省事","official_note":"知內待省事是唐代内侍省（宦官机构）的职务，负责管理宫廷事务，此处高力士以此职掌权。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"知內待省事","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"1cb16047-7c49-4909-a015-d5c9dc28135e"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"驃騎大將軍","official_note":"驃騎大將軍是唐代高级武散官，象征荣誉和地位，此处高力士加此衔，显示其恩宠。","official_rank":"从一品","source_snippet":"驃騎大將軍","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"647c025d-d6e1-4d1a-9741-656aae80dafb"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":689,"link_death_year":762,"link_td_description":"高力士，本名冯元一，是唐朝的著名宦官。","link_td_id":"Q10005158","link_td_number_id":59019,"people_name":"高力士","people_name_jianti_auto":"高力士","people_xingming":"高力士","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5ee6-db0e-11ef-be37-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":689,"link_death_year":762,"link_td_description":"高力士，本名冯元一，是唐朝的著名宦官。","link_td_id":"Q10005158","link_td_number_id":59019,"people_name":"力士","people_name_jianti_auto":"力士","people_xingming":"高力士","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5ee7-db0e-11ef-88c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":683,"link_death_year":753,"link_td_description":"李林甫，小名哥奴，号月堂，陕西人。唐朝远房宗室、权臣、奸臣。唐玄宗开元二十二年（734年）五月，出任礼部尚书同中书门下平章事，从此任相十九年。","link_td_id":"Q10008274","link_td_number_id":181807,"people_name":"李林甫","people_name_jianti_auto":"李林甫","people_xingming":"李林甫","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5ee8-db0e-11ef-a097-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":703,"link_death_year":757,"link_td_description":"安禄山，营州柳城（今辽宁省朝阳市）人，本姓康，名轧荦山。父为昭武九姓的粟特人，母为突厥巫师，信仰祆教。是唐代藩镇割据势力之一的最初建立者，也是安史之乱的主要发动人之一，后建立大燕政权，自称雄武皇帝，年号圣武。","link_td_id":"Q10000104","link_td_number_id":64765,"people_name":"安祿山","people_name_jianti_auto":"安禄山","people_xingming":"安禄山","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5ee9-db0e-11ef-8a8a-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":689,"link_death_year":762,"link_td_description":"高力士，本名冯元一，是唐朝的著名宦官。","link_td_id":"Q10005158","link_td_number_id":59019,"people_name":"力士","people_name_jianti_auto":"力士","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5eea-db0e-11ef-8f14-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"西京","place_name_jianti_auto":"西京","resolved_place_entity_id":454,"start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5eeb-db0e-11ef-90c8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"寶壽寺","place_name_jianti_auto":"宝寿寺","resolved_place_entity_id":6681,"start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5eec-db0e-11ef-afba-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","权争"],"content":"1夏，四月，辛丑，左監門大將軍、知內待省事高力士加驃騎大將軍。力士承恩歲久，中外畏之，太子亦呼之爲兄，諸王公呼之爲翁，駙馬輩直謂之爺。自李林甫、安祿山輩皆因之以取將相。其家富厚不貲。於西京作寶壽寺，寺鐘成，力士作齋以慶之，舉朝畢集。擊鐘一杵，施錢百緡，有求媚者至二十杵，少者不減十杵。然性和謹少過，善觀時俯仰，不敢驕橫，故天子終親任之，士大夫亦不疾惡也。","content_fanyi":"夏季四月辛丑日，左监门大将军、知内侍省事高力士被加授骠骑大将军。高力士久承恩宠，朝廷内外都畏惧他，太子也称他为兄，各位王公称他为翁，驸马一辈人则直接叫他爷。李林甫、安禄山这些人，都通过他取得将相职位。他家财产雄厚，不可计量。他在西京修建宝寿寺，寺钟铸成后，高力士设斋会庆祝，满朝官员全部到齐。撞钟一下，施舍钱一百缗，有逢迎献媚的人撞到二十下，最少的也不少于十下。但他性情温和谨慎，少有过失，善于观察时势而周旋进退，不敢骄横，所以天子始终亲近信任他，士大夫也不憎恶他。","content_jianti_auto":"1夏，四月，辛丑，左监门大将军、知内待省事高力士加骠骑大将军。力士承恩岁久，中外畏之，太子亦呼之为兄，诸王公呼之为翁，驸马辈直谓之爷。自李林甫、安禄山辈皆因之以取将相。其家富厚不赀。于西京作宝寿寺，寺钟成，力士作斋以庆之，举朝毕集。击钟一杵，施钱百缗，有求媚者至二十杵，少者不减十杵。然性和谨少过，善观时俯仰，不敢骄横，故天子终亲任之，士大夫亦不疾恶也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21806,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5edd-db0e-11ef-b384-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[