lace_name_jianti_auto":"商","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5efd-db0e-11ef-b932-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"夏","place_name_jianti_auto":"夏","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5efe-db0e-11ef-afce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"殷","place_name_jianti_auto":"殷","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5eff-db0e-11ef-8cde-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"梁","start_index":228,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f00-db0e-11ef-a0f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":363,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f01-db0e-11ef-9f92-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":368,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f02-db0e-11ef-a788-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":370,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f03-db0e-11ef-a7c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":383,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f04-db0e-11ef-b0d7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"三恪、二王後，註已見前。杜佑曰：周得天下，封夏、殷二王後，又封舜後，謂之恪。恪，敬也；義取王之所敬，故曰三恪。天寶十三載，公卿議曰：三恪、二王之議，有三說焉。一曰，二王之前，更立三代之後爲三恪。此據樂記「武王克商，未及下車封黃帝、堯、舜之後，下車封夏、殷之後」而言。一曰，二王之前，但存一代，通二王爲三恪。此據左傳「但封胡公以備三恪」，明王者所敬先王有二，更封一代以備三恪。三云，二王之後爲一恪，妻之父母爲二恪，夷狄之君爲三恪。此據「王有不臣者三」而言之。梁崔靈恩云：三說以初爲長。按二王、三恪，經無正文，靈恩據禮記，遂以爲通存五代，竊恐未安。記云：尊賢不過二代；第三代者，雖遠難師法，豈得不錄其後！故亦存之，示敬其道而已，因謂之三恪。故左傳云：「封胡公以備三恪。」足知其無五代也。況歷代至今，皆以三代爲三恪焉。以此考之，蓋以後魏子孫與周、隋子孫爲三恪也。明年，尋罷魏後；註又見後。","note_content_jianti_auto":"三恪、二王后，注已见前。杜佑曰：周得天下，封夏、殷二王后，又封舜后，谓之恪。恪，敬也；义取王之所敬，故曰三恪。天宝十三载，公卿议曰：三恪、二王之议，有三说焉。一曰，二王之前，更立三代之后为三恪。此据乐记「武王克商，未及下车封黄帝、尧、舜之后，下车封夏、殷之后」而言。一曰，二王之前，但存一代，通二王为三恪。此据左传「但封胡公以备三恪」，明王者所敬先王有二，更封一代以备三恪。三云，二王之后为一恪，妻之父母为二恪，夷狄之君为三恪。此据「王有不臣者三」而言之。梁崔灵恩云：三说以初为长。按二王、三恪，经无正文，灵恩据礼记，遂以为通存五代，窃恐未安。记云：尊贤不过二代；第三代者，虽远难师法，岂得不录其后！故亦存之，示敬其道而已，因谓之三恪。故左传云：「封胡公以备三恪。」足知其无五代也。况历代至今，皆以三代为三恪焉。以此考之，盖以后魏子孙与周、隋子孙为三恪也。明年，寻罢魏后；注又见后。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5eef-db0e-11ef-aeee-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"羣臣","official_note":"羣臣泛指朝廷中的官员群体，在资治通鉴中常指代参与朝政的文武百官，此处表示官员们共同向皇帝上尊号，体现了集体行动。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"羣臣上尊號曰開元天寶聖文神武應道皇帝","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"d1045aa4-63b5-41bf-bd99-78c273525570"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":685,"link_death_year":762,"link_td_description":"唐玄宗李隆基，唐朝第9任皇帝，為唐睿宗李旦第三子，母为睿宗窦德妃，是唐朝及中国历史上最为著名的帝王之一，其前后共在位近44年（公元712年－756年），使用年号3个（先天、开元、天宝），後退居太上皇6年，享寿77岁，是唐朝在位最久与最长寿的皇帝，庙号玄宗，谥号至道大圣大明孝皇帝。","link_td_id":"Q10000018","link_td_number_id":7615,"people_name":"開元天寶聖文神武應道皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"开元天宝圣文神武应道皇帝","people_xingming":"唐玄宗","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f0a-db0e-11ef-b79c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","resolved_place_entity_id":4,"start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f0b-db0e-11ef-b6cd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2五月，壬午，羣臣上尊號曰開元天寶聖文神武應道皇帝；赦天下，免百姓來載租庸，擇後魏子孫一人爲三恪。","content_fanyi":"五月壬午日，群臣向皇帝进上尊号，称开元天宝圣文神武应道皇帝；大赦天下，免除百姓来年应缴的租粮和绢帛，选立北魏宗室子孙一人为三恪。","content_jianti_auto":"2五月，壬午，群臣上尊号曰开元天宝圣文神武应道皇帝；赦天下，免百姓来载租庸，择后魏子孙一人为三恪。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21807,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5eed-db0e-11ef-94b8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":703,"link_death_year":757,"link_td_description":"安禄山，营州柳城（今辽宁省朝阳市）人，本姓康，名轧荦山。父为昭武九姓的粟特人，母为突厥巫师，信仰祆教。是唐代藩镇割据势力之一的最初建立者，也是安史之乱的主要发动人之一，后建立大燕政权，自称雄武皇帝，年号圣武。","link_td_id":"Q10000104","link_td_number_id":64765,"people_name":"安祿山","people_name_jianti_auto":"安禄山","people_xingming":"安禄山","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f0d-db0e-11ef-8e60-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"3六月，庚子，賜安祿山鐵券。","content_fanyi":"六月庚子日，朝廷赐给安禄山铁券。","content_jianti_auto":"3六月，庚子，赐安禄山铁券。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21808,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f0c-db0e-11ef-b975-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"洪邁","people_name_jianti_auto":"洪迈","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f10-db0e-11ef-9ac5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"楊國忠","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨国忠","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f11-db0e-11ef-824e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蜀郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀郡","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f12-db0e-11ef-9d30-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"劍南","place_name_jianti_auto":"剑南","start_index":97,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f13-db0e-11ef-95ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"山南西道","place_name_jianti_auto":"山南西道","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f14-db0e-11ef-bba2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"兩京","place_name_jianti_auto":"两京","start_index":125,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f15-db0e-11ef-975d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長春","place_name_jianti_auto":"长春","start_index":143,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f16-db0e-11ef-9b60-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"九成宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"九成宫","start_index":146,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f17-db0e-11ef-9647-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"關內道","place_name_jianti_auto":"关内道","start_index":152,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f18-db0e-11ef-a65c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京畿","place_name_jianti_auto":"京畿","start_index":156,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f19-db0e-11ef-bbe8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"集賢殿","place_name_jianti_auto":"集贤殿","start_index":174,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f1a-db0e-11ef-9ebc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"崇玄館","place_name_jianti_auto":"崇玄馆","start_index":178,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f1b-db0e-11ef-9cf3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太清","place_name_jianti_auto":"太清","start_index":188,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f1c-db0e-11ef-ae52-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"紫微宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"紫微宫","start_index":191,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f1d-db0e-11ef-a5c0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"釗，音昭。斂，力贍翻。惡，烏路翻。使，疏吏翻。洪邁隨筆曰：楊國忠爲度支郞，領十五餘使，至宰相，凡領四十餘使，新、舊唐史皆不詳載其職。按其拜相制前銜云：御史大夫、判度支、權知太府卿事、兼蜀郡長史、劍南節度·支度·營田等副大使、本道兼山南西道采訪處置使、兩京太府出納監倉、祠祭、木炭、宮市、長春·九成宮等使、關內道及京畿采訪處置使，拜右相，兼吏部尚書、集賢殿·崇玄館學士、修國史、太清·紫微宮使；自於所領，又有管當租庸、鑄錢等使。以是觀之，槪可見矣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"钊，音昭。敛，力赡翻。恶，乌路翻。使，疏吏翻。洪迈随笔曰：杨国忠为度支郞，领十五余使，至宰相，凡领四十余使，新、旧唐史皆不详载其职。按其拜相制前衔云：御史大夫、判度支、权知太府卿事、兼蜀郡长史、剑南节度·支度·营田等副大使、本道兼山南西道采访处置使、两京太府出纳监仓、祠祭、木炭、宫市、长春·九成宫等使、关内道及京畿采访处置使，拜右相，兼吏部尚书、集贤殿·崇玄馆学士、修国史、太清·紫微宫使；自于所领，又有管当租庸、铸钱等使。以是观之，槪可见矣。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f0f-db0e-11ef-91e2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"财政","official_name":"度支郞中","official_note":"度支郞中为唐代户部度支司的官员，负责国家财政收支管理，此处表示杨钊的初始官职，用于说明其财政背景。","official_rank":"从五品上","source_snippet":"度支郞中兼侍御史楊釗善窺上意所愛惡而迎之","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"eb057380-1025-4669-8258-5e75ea74e25f"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"侍御史","official_note":"侍御史为唐代御史台的官员，负责监察百官，此处表示杨钊兼任此职，以增强其权力和影响力。","official_rank":"从六品下","source_snippet":"度支郞中兼侍御史楊釗善窺上意所愛惡而迎之","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"c0163e90-1a9d-46ba-9978-3b16fc071c6b"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"給事中","official_note":"給事中为唐代门下省的官员，负责审核诏令和奏章，此处表示杨钊升迁至此职，显示其恩宠日隆。","official_rank":"正五品上","source_snippet":"甲辰，遷給事中，兼御史中丞","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"74e56ed2-d414-488d-9ef2-5970601990eb"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"御史中丞","official_note":"御史中丞为唐代御史台的副长官，负责监察和弹劾，此处表示杨钊兼任此职，进一步扩大其监察权力。","official_rank":"正四品下","source_snippet":"甲辰，遷給事中，兼御史中丞","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"75d40e38-2255-4342-9e38-1cb52419d953"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":756,"link_td_description":"杨国忠，本名杨钊，唐玄宗赐名“国忠”，蒲州永乐（在今山西省永济市和芮城县）人，唐代权臣，与杨贵妃同一曾祖父的从兄（一说同一祖父的堂兄），是为唐朝外戚。玄宗时与李林甫勾结，权倾内外，李林甫死，为宰相，身兼四十余职，家族豪富登天。安禄山、史思明以“诛国忠、清君侧”为名，发动安史之乱。杨国忠随玄宗奔蜀，马嵬之变中被士兵诛杀。","link_td_id":"Q10000207","link_td_number_id":132019,"people_name":"楊釗","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨钊","people_xingming":"杨钊","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f22-db0e-11ef-873b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","内政"],"content":"4度支郞中兼侍御史楊釗善窺上意所愛惡而迎之，以聚斂驟遷，歲中領十五餘使。甲辰，遷給事中，兼御史中丞，專判度支事，恩幸日隆。","content_fanyi":"度支郎中兼侍御史杨钊善于窥测皇上的好恶并迎合其心意，凭借聚敛而迅速升迁，一年之中兼领十五种以上使职。甲辰日，升任给事中，兼任御史中丞，专门负责度支事务，所受恩宠日益隆盛。","content_jianti_auto":"4度支郞中兼侍御史杨钊善窥上意所爱恶而迎之，以聚敛骤迁，岁中领十五余使。甲辰，迁给事中，兼御史中丞，专判度支事，恩幸日隆。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21809,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f0e-db0e-11ef-876c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"記·大學：百乘之家，不畜聚斂之臣；與其有聚斂之臣，寧有盜臣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"记·大学：百乘之家，不畜聚敛之臣；与其有聚敛之臣，宁有盗臣。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":147,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f27-db0e-11ef-8b72-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":805,"link_td_description":"苏冕，字正元，京兆武功（今陕西武功西）人，唐朝儒学家，著有《会要》四十卷、《古今国典》一百卷等。","link_td_id":"Q10014480","link_td_number_id":2932128,"people_name":"蘇冕","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏冕","people_xingming":"苏冕","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f29-db0e-11ef-a144-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":730,"link_td_description":"宇文融，京兆府万年县（今陕西西安市长安县）人，唐朝宰相。","link_td_id":"Q10011081","link_td_number_id":1216597,"people_name":"宇文融","people_name_jianti_auto":"宇文融","people_xingming":"宇文融","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f2a-db0e-11ef-8487-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":747,"link_td_description":"杨慎矜，唐朝政治人物，隋炀帝后代。曾依附杨国忠、李林甫，诬陷大臣，后因得罪李林甫，被唐玄宗赐死。","link_td_id":"Q10009499","link_td_number_id":722178,"people_name":"楊愼矜","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨愼矜","people_xingming":"杨慎矜","start_index":113,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f2b-db0e-11ef-a2ae-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":752,"link_td_description":"王鉷，太原郡祁县（今山西省祁县南）人，唐朝大臣，封太原县公，兼殿中监。","link_td_id":"Q10012724","link_td_number_id":1499907,"people_name":"王鉷","people_name_jianti_auto":"王𫟹","people_xingming":"王鉷","start_index":117,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f2c-db0e-11ef-8105-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":756,"link_td_description":"杨国忠，本名杨钊，唐玄宗赐名“国忠”，蒲州永乐（在今山西省永济市和芮城县）人，唐代权臣，与杨贵妃同一曾祖父的从兄（一说同一祖父的堂兄），是为唐朝外戚。玄宗时与李林甫勾结，权倾内外，李林甫死，为宰相，身兼四十余职，家族豪富登天。安禄山、史思明以“诛国忠、清君侧”为名，发动安史之乱。杨国忠随玄宗奔蜀，马嵬之变中被士兵诛杀。","link_td_id":"Q10000207","link_td_number_id":132019,"people_name":"楊國忠","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨国忠","people_xingming":"杨国忠","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f2d-db0e-11ef-b598-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-551,"link_death_year":-479,"link_td_description":"孔丘，春秋末期鲁国的教育家与哲学家，儒家创始人兼主要代表人物。","link_td_id":"Q10000008","link_td_number_id":484,"people_name":"仲尼","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲尼","people_xingming":"孔子","start_index":132,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f2e-db0e-11ef-a756-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["史论"],"content":"蘇冕論曰：設官分職，各有司存。政有恆而易守，事歸本而難失，經遠之理，捨此奚據！洎姦臣廣言利以邀恩，多立使以示寵，刻下民以厚斂，張虛數以獻狀；上心蕩而益奢，人望怨而成禍；使天子有司守其位而無其事，受厚祿而虛其用。宇文融首唱其端，楊愼矜、王鉷繼遵其軌，楊國忠終成其亂。仲尼云：寧有盜臣而無聚斂之臣。誠哉是言！前車旣覆，後轍未改，求達化本，不亦難乎！　　","content_fanyi":"苏冕评论说：设立官职、区分职掌，各有主管的官署。政令有常规就容易遵守，事务归于本分就难以出错，治理长远的道理，离开这一点还能依据什么！待到奸臣大肆宣扬财利来邀取恩宠，大量设立使职来表示宠信，盘剥下民来加重征收，虚报数字来呈献成绩；君上心思放纵而更加奢侈，百姓心怀怨恨而酿成祸患；使得天子的官员们空守职位却无事可做，享受厚禄却虚耗其用。宇文融首开其端，杨慎矜、王鉷随后沿袭他的路子，杨国忠最终酿成祸乱。孔子说：宁可有个盗窃公家财物的臣子，也不要聚敛民财的臣子。这话实在正确啊！前面的车子已经倾覆，后面的车辙仍不改变，想求得教化之本，不也太难了吗！","content_jianti_auto":"苏冕论曰：设官分职，各有司存。政有恒而易守，事归本而难失，经远之理，舍此奚据！洎奸臣广言利以邀恩，多立使以示宠，刻下民以厚敛，张虚数以献状；上心荡而益奢，人望怨而成祸；使天子有司守其位而无其事，受厚禄而虚其用。宇文融首唱其端，杨愼矜、王𫟹继遵其轨，杨国忠终成其乱。仲尼云：宁有盗臣而无聚敛之臣。诚哉是言！前车既覆，后辙未改，求达化本，不亦难乎！　　","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21810,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f23-db0e-11ef-90d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"華清宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"华清宫","place_note":"骊山温泉•陕西临潼境","resolved_place_entity_id":1315,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f30-db0e-11ef-ae00-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"5冬，十月，庚戌，上幸華清宮。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十月庚戌日，皇上前往华清宫。","content_jianti_auto":"5冬，十月，庚戌，上幸华清宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21811,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f2f-db0e-11ef-bffc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"姊，蔣兕翻。掖，音亦。命婦，外命婦也。見，賢遍翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"姊，蒋兕翻。掖，音亦。命妇，外命妇也。见，贤遍翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f32-db0e-11ef-b580-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"玉眞公主","people_name_jianti_auto":"玉真公主","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f34-db0e-11ef-9ecf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"睿宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"睿宗","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f35-db0e-11ef-840b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"玉眞公主，睿宗之女。","note_content_jianti_auto":"玉真公主，睿宗之女。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f33-db0e-11ef-8e90-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"銛，丑廉翻。錡，魚奇翻。遺，于季翻；下獻遺同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"铦，丑廉翻。锜，鱼奇翻。遗，于季翻；下献遗同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":117,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f36-db0e-11ef-abce-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":19,"source_start_index":8,"source_text":"見二百十三卷開元十五年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"bcdc6b70-db0e-11ef-89e4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"十王宅、百孫院，見二百十三卷開元十五年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"十王宅、百孙院，见二百十三卷开元十五年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":143,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f37-db0e-11ef-a4c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f3c-db0e-11ef-9ea0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"揚雄","people_name_jianti_auto":"扬雄","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f3d-db0e-11ef-9fb4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"嗤，丑之翻。蜥，先擊翻。蜴，羊益翻。師古曰：爾雅云：蠑螈，蜥蜴；蝘蜓，守宮。是則一類耳。揚雄方言云：在澤中者謂之蜥蜴。","note_content_jianti_auto":"嗤，丑之翻。蜥，先击翻。蜴，羊益翻。师古曰：尔雅云：蝾螈，蜥蜴；蝘蜓，守宫。是则一类耳。扬雄方言云：在泽中者谓之蜥蜴。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":303,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f3b-db0e-11ef-aa52-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"崔氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"崔氏","people_xingming":"崔氏","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f40-db0e-11ef-abeb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韓國夫人","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩国夫人","people_xingming":"韩国夫人","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f41-db0e-11ef-a0d4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"裴氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"裴氏","people_xingming":"裴氏","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f42-db0e-11ef-bf3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"虢國夫人","people_name_jianti_auto":"虢国夫人","people_xingming":"虢国夫人","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f43-db0e-11ef-9365-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"柳氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"柳氏","people_xingming":"柳氏","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f44-db0e-11ef-ad47-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"秦國夫人","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦国夫人","people_xingming":"秦国夫人","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f45-db0e-11ef-9cd5-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":692,"link_death_year":762,"link_td_description":"玉真公主，唐朝公主、女道士，唐睿宗第九女，母窦德妃，唐玄宗、金仙公主同母妹。","link_td_id":"Q10002640","link_td_number_id":1467716,"people_name":"玉眞公主","people_name_jianti_auto":"玉真公主","people_xingming":"李持盈","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f46-db0e-11ef-8700-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"銛","people_name_jianti_auto":"铦","people_xingming":"杨铦","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33ea-db0e-11ef-9855-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"錡","people_name_jianti_auto":"锜","people_xingming":"杨锜","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33eb-db0e-11ef-8079-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韓","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩","people_xingming":"韩国夫人","start_index":149,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33ec-db0e-11ef-ad37-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"虢","people_name_jianti_auto":"虢","people_xingming":"虢国夫人","start_index":151,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33ed-db0e-11ef-aeb1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"虢國","people_name_jianti_auto":"虢国","people_xingming":"虢国夫人","start_index":212,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33ee-db0e-11ef-b64c-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":660,"link_death_year":719,"link_td_description":"韦嗣立，字延构，郑州阳武县（今河南省原阳县）人。其父韦思谦曾经担任宰相，韦嗣立于武则天长安末年与异母兄韦承庆同时任宰相，十余年间，父子三人相继为宰相，被传为美谈。唐中宗景龙三年（709年）再次任兵部尚书、同中书门下三品（宰相），因与韦皇后同宗，被封为逍遥公，次年任中书令。唐睿宗即位后，被贬出为刺史。","link_td_id":"Q10005740","link_td_number_id":3535487,"people_name":"韋嗣立","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦嗣立","people_xingming":"韦嗣立","start_index":227,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33ef-db0e-11ef-846e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韋氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦氏","people_xingming":"韦氏","start_index":245,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33f0-db0e-11ef-a71d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"虢國","people_name_jianti_auto":"虢国","people_xingming":"虢国夫人","start_index":276,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33f1-db0e-11ef-a8f4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"bd9b5f31-db0e-11ef-8686-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"xiān","source_anchor_text":"位三姊與銛錡五家凡","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":91,"text":"銛","tongjian_id":"0adc1ccd-7285-59ce-a5b5-0f065be9deca"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"bd9b5f31-db0e-11ef-8686-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"wū","source_anchor_text":"既成召工圬墁約錢二","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":262,"text":"圬","tongjian_id":"0064df72-0f28-558c-b593-1a2ae7eb5966"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"6十一月，癸未，以貴妃姊適崔氏者爲韓國夫人，適裴氏者爲虢國夫人，適柳氏者爲秦國夫人。三人皆有才色，上呼之爲姨，出入宮掖，並承恩澤，勢傾天下。每命婦入見，玉眞公主等皆讓不敢就位。三姊與銛、錡五家，凡有請託，府縣承迎，峻於制敕；四方賂遺，輻湊其門，惟恐居後，朝夕如市。十宅諸王及百孫院婚嫁，皆以錢千緡賂韓、虢使請，無不如志。上所賜與及四方獻遺，五家如一。競開第舍，極其壯麗，一堂之費，動踰千萬；旣成，見他人有勝己者，輒毀而改爲。虢國尤爲豪蕩，一旦，帥工徒突入韋嗣立宅，卽撤去舊屋，自爲新第，但授韋氏以隙地十畝而已。中堂旣成，召工圬墁，約錢二百萬；復求賞技，虢國以絳羅五百段賞之，嗤而不顧，曰：「請取螻蟻、蜥蜴，記其數置堂中，苟失一物，不敢受直。」","content_fanyi":"十一月癸未日，玄宗册封杨贵妃嫁给崔氏的姐姐为韩国夫人，嫁给裴氏的姐姐为虢国夫人，嫁给柳氏的姐姐为秦国夫人。三人都有才华姿色，玄宗称她们为姨，她们出入宫禁，一同承受恩泽，权势倾动天下。每当有命妇入宫朝见，玉真公主等人都谦让不敢就座。杨贵妃的三个姐姐与杨铦、杨锜五家，凡有请托，府县官员都奉承接待，比奉行皇帝诏令还要严厉急切；四方赠送的财物像车辐聚向车毂一样汇集到他们门下，人们唯恐落后，从早到晚如同集市。十宅诸王和百孙院中凡有婚嫁，都用一千缗钱贿赂韩国夫人、虢国夫人，请她们代为请求，没有不称心如愿的。玄宗所赏赐的和四方进献的财物，五家所得完全一样。他们竞相营建宅第，极其壮丽，一座厅堂的费用，动辄超过一千万钱；建成之后，如果看到别人家有胜过自己的，就拆毁重建。虢国夫人尤其豪放不羁，一天早晨，她率领工匠突然闯入韦嗣立的宅第，立即拆掉原有房屋，为自己建造新宅，只给了韦家十亩空地而已。中堂建成后，她召来工匠涂饰墙壁，约定工钱二百万；工匠又要求赏赐技艺，虢国夫人拿绛罗五百段赏给他，工匠嗤笑而不屑一顾，说：“请捉来蝼蚁、蜥蜴，记下数目放在堂中，如果丢失一只，我不敢接受报酬。”","content_jianti_auto":"6十一月，癸未，以贵妃姊适崔氏者为韩国夫人，适裴氏者为虢国夫人，适柳氏者为秦国夫人。三人皆有才色，上呼之为姨，出入宫掖，并承恩泽，势倾天下。每命妇入见，玉真公主等皆让不敢就位。三姊与铦、锜五家，凡有请托，府县承迎，峻于制敕；四方赂遗，辐凑其门，惟恐居后，朝夕如市。十宅诸王及百孙院婚嫁，皆以钱千缗赂韩、虢使请，无不如志。上所赐与及四方献遗，五家如一。竞开第舍，极其壮丽，一堂之费，动逾千万；既成，见他人有胜己者，辄毁而改为。虢国尤为豪荡，一旦，帅工徒突入韦嗣立宅，即撤去旧屋，自为新第，但授韦氏以隙地十亩而已。中堂既成，召工圬墁，约钱二百万；复求赏技，虢国以绛罗五百段赏之，嗤而不顾，曰：「请取蝼蚁、蜥蜴，记其数置堂中，苟失一物，不敢受直。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21812,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"bd9b5f31-db0e-11ef-8686-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"老君","people_name_jianti_auto":"老君","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33f4-db0e-11ef-862e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"華清宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"华清宫","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33f5-db0e-11ef-b633-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"老君殿","place_name_jianti_auto":"老君殿","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33f6-db0e-11ef-bc20-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"朝元閣","place_name_jianti_auto":"朝元阁","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33f7-db0e-11ef-a3a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"降聖閣","place_name_jianti_auto":"降圣阁","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33f8-db0e-11ef-892c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"上於華清宮中起老君殿，殿之北爲朝元閣，以或言老君降于此，改曰降聖閣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"上于华清宫中起老君殿，殿之北为朝元阁，以或言老君降于此，改曰降圣阁。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33f3-db0e-11ef-bba7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"溫泉宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"温泉宫","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33fa-db0e-11ef-ad71-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"自溫泉宮。還，從宣翻，又音如字。","note_content_jianti_auto":"自温泉宫。还，从宣翻，又音如字。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33f9-db0e-11ef-8871-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-571,"link_death_year":-471,"link_td_description":"老子，春秋时期思想家，道家及道教的奠基者，著有《道德经》。","link_td_id":"Q10000007","link_td_number_id":2195,"people_name":"玄元皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"玄元皇帝","people_xingming":"李耳","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33fb-db0e-11ef-9e54-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[李耳]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"朝元閣","place_name_jianti_auto":"朝元阁","resolved_place_entity_id":7356,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33fc-db0e-11ef-8f4d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"會昌縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"会昌县","place_note":"陕西临潼","resolved_place_entity_id":4725,"start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33fd-db0e-11ef-867b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"昭應","place_name_jianti_auto":"昭应","resolved_place_entity_id":1922,"start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33fe-db0e-11ef-aa33-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新豐","place_name_jianti_auto":"新丰","place_note":"陕西临潼东北新丰镇","resolved_place_entity_id":1112,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33ff-db0e-11ef-899d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"昭應","place_name_jianti_auto":"昭应","resolved_place_entity_id":1922,"start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"bd9d3400-db0e-11ef-bff0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"7十二月，戊戌，或言玄元皇帝降於朝元閣，制改會昌縣曰昭應，廢新豐入昭應。辛酉，上還宮。","content_fanyi":"十二月戊戌日，有人声称玄元皇帝降临朝元阁，皇上下诏将会昌县改名为昭应县，撤销新丰县并入昭应。辛酉日，皇上返回宫中。","content_jianti_auto":"7十二月，戊戌，或言玄元皇帝降于朝元阁，制改会昌县曰昭应，废新丰入昭应。辛酉，上还宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21813,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"bd9d33f2-db0e-11ef-a689-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"在青海筑城以巩固边防","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_BD9DA959DB0E11EFAA66A0D3651F611F_01"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"青海","place_name_jianti_auto":"青海","place_note":"青海湖","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"bd9da95b-db0e-11ef-8d51-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龍駒島","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙驹岛","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"bd9da95c-db0e-11ef-b7fa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"吐，從暾入聲。青海周八九百里，中有山，須冰合遊牝馬其上，明年生駒，號龍種，故謂之龍駒島。","note_content_jianti_auto":"吐，从暾入声。青海周八九百里，中有山，须冰合游牝马其上，明年生驹，号龙种，故谓之龙驹岛。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"bd9da95a-db0e-11ef-a436-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":757,"link_td_description":"哥舒翰，姓哥舒名翰，陇西郡（今甘肃省定西市）人，突骑施（西突厥别部）首领哥舒部落人，唐朝名将。","link_td_id":"Q10008174","link_td_number_id":131313,"people_name":"哥舒翰","people_name_jianti_auto":"哥舒翰","people_xingming":"哥舒翰","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"bd9da95e-db0e-11ef-8bac-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_d